The TeX virtual machine, preloaded LaTeX/PGF format and TeX inputs come
from the rust_tikz 0.1.0 distribution of TikZJax.
https://crates.io/crates/rust_tikz/0.1.0
https://github.com/kisonecat/tikzjax
https://github.com/kisonecat/web2js

The Rust host links the guest into shared WebAssembly memory. tex/build.py
pins the upstream archives, describes the linkage and rebuilds the assets.
The format includes LaTeX2e 2020 and the PGF SVG driver. Additional TeX
inputs are the original mhchem v3.11, calc and twoopt from TeX Live.
The files in texmf.tar.gz retain their upstream copyright and license notices.
https://www.latex-project.org/lppl/
https://tikz.dev/license

No fonts are bundled. Text and math are typeset using the host Typst fonts.
